## MIL-X — the port

Everything under `milx/` is original work by Pedro Nobre, licensed under the **GNU General
Public License, version 3** (see `LICENSE`). It was called OpenDIAL until version 1.0, and the
folder was `opendial/`. It is a macOS, Windows and Linux port of MS-DIAL 5: an open
